OL,3,GNEWSAMental health is no joke - but
OL,4,AI've turned it into a stand-up routine
OL,5,
OL,6,FStepping onto the stage for the first
OL,7,Ftime, Michael Hart is "flying" with
OL,8,Fadrenaline.
OL,10,FHe didn't think he had it in him, but
OL,11,Fhe's about to tell his own jokes to a
OL,12,Froom full of strangers.
OL,14,FHe stutters at first but soon gets his
OL,15,Ffirst laugh from the crowd and the
OL,16,Fnerves he's feeling are washed away by
OL,17,Fa wave of elation.
OL,19,FNow he's on a roll...
